{'symbol': 'MA', 'date': '2023-01-26 08:00:00', 'title': "MASTERCARD INCORPORATED FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS AVAILABLE ON COMPANY'S WEBSITE", 'text': "PURCHASE, N.Y.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--MASTERCARD INCORPORATED (NYSE: MA) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS THROUGH AN EARNINGS RELEASE AVAILABLE ON THE COMPANY'S INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSITE AT INVESTOR.MASTERCARD.COM. THE EARNINGS RELEASE WILL BE FURNISHED WITH THE SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION (SEC) ON A FORM 8-K AND AVAILABLE HERE."}